{"id":"fecd9d857d0daf42","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-unique-limit-point-bound.md","title":"可计算闭类的唯一极限点可由二次跳跃计算","display":"thm-unique-limit-point-bound — 可计算闭类的唯一极限点可由二次跳跃计算","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-unique-limit-point-bound","aliases":["20-thm-unique-limit-point-bound"],"display":"thm-unique-limit-point-bound — 可计算闭类的唯一极限点可由二次跳跃计算","chapter":"8","section":"8.7","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 8.7.2","source_printed_pages":[171],"source_pdf_pages":[204],"depends_on":["[[20-lem-splitting-derivative-complexity]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-unique-limit-point-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-unique-limit-point-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-unique-limit-point-bound — 可计算闭类的唯一极限点可由二次跳跃计算"},{"key":"chapter","html":"8"},{"key":"section","html":"8.7"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 8.7.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>171</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>204</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4ffcd8be1ef80ce4\" href=\"?note=4ffcd8be1ef80ce4\" title=\"20-lem-splitting-derivative-complexity\">20-lem-splitting-derivative-complexity</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 可计算，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D([T])=\\{X\\}\">\\(D([T])=\\{X\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ffcd8be1ef80ce4\" href=\"?note=4ffcd8be1ef80ce4\" title=\"20-lem-splitting-derivative-complexity\">20-lem-splitting-derivative-complexity</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}unique-limit-point-bound}\\vdash X\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;&#39;.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}unique-limit-point-bound}\\vdash X\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;&#39;.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>上游给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(T)\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;&#39;\">\\(S(T)\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;&#39;\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[S(T)]=\\{X\\}\">\\([S(T)]=\\{X\\}\\)</span>。从当前正确前缀的两个子节点，同时用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;&#39;\\)</span> 检查各有限层是否为空；唯一无限路径保证错误分支的有限空层终被找到，故逐位计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>。这证明练习上界，不宣称每个极限点或每个可计算闭类成员都在该跳跃以下。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 171 / PDF 204。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-lem-splitting-derivative-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"4ffcd8be1ef80ce4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-splitting-derivative-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-splitting-derivative-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"4ffcd8be1ef80ce4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-lem-splitting-derivative-complexity]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"D([T])=\\{X\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}unique-limit-point-bound}\\vdash X\\le_T\\varnothing''.","display":true},{"tex":"S(T)\\le_T\\varnothing''","display":false},{"tex":"[S(T)]=\\{X\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing''","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1261,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["4ffcd8be1ef80ce4"]}